          se |    1.4258     0.9936 
Overall maximum convergence ratio: 0.082 (criterion: below 0.25; met)
Convergence t-ratios (criterion: all below 0.1 in absolute value): met

. 
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------
. * Part 1: endowment and creation. Split an effect into a part that
. * counts when a tie is created and a part that counts when a tie
. * is given up.
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------
. nwsaom, waves(glasgow1 glasgow2 glasgow3) outdegree reciprocity endow(transties) creation(transtie
> s) seed(6)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SAOM (Method of Moments, conditional), waves: glasgow1 glasgow2 glasgow3
Actors: 50                             Periods: 2
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
glasgow1_to_gla~3 | Coefficient  Std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
